<title>SINGAPORE: Eltech in S$10.2 mln bid for land parcel.</title>
<headline>Eltech in S$10.2 mln bid for land parcel.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eltech Electronics Ltd said on Monday it had placed the highest bid of Singapore $10.2 million for a 99-year lease on a 3,930 sq metre piece of residential land parcel in the central region of Singapore.</p>
<p>Eltech said in a statement it would make a further announcement once its bid was confirmed as successful by the Urban Redevelopment Authority.</p>
<p>The company said in February it was setting up a property development subsidiary to handle a diversification into real estate.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
